geargrafx (1.6.10-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * MCP server (local and remote)
  * [MCP] Bundles (.mcpb) for Claude Desktop and similar
  * [MCP] Improved tool descriptions
  * [MCP] Added resources (docs)
  * > This enables direct integration between Geargrafx and AI agents,
    giving them full read/write access to the emulator state and complete
    control of the built-in debugger.
  * Agents can observe and act exactly like a human using the debugger,
    making this a powerful tool for homebrew development, rom-hacking,
    reverse engineering, or diagnosing complex behavior.
  * It works seamlessly with VS Code, ChatGPT, Claude and similar
    environments that support MCP.
  * Check out the docs.
  * NOTE: This is an EXPERIMENTAL release, there may be bugs!

